# Server-side only — never exposed to the browser. Required for ACA
# Marketplace plan search and provider-coverage checks (Original Medicare
# checks work without this, since that uses a separate, keyless CMS dataset).
# Get a free key at https://developer.cms.gov/marketplace-api/key-request.html
# Keys expire every 60 days and CMS auto-emails a replacement.
CMS_MARKETPLACE_API_KEY=
